1 <= k <= num.length
1 <= x <= 100

### 解题思路
此处撰写解题思路

### 代码

```java
class Solution {
    public int[] findClosestElements(int[] arr, int k, int x) {
        int left = 0;
        int right = arr.length - 1;
        while (right - left >= k) {
            if (Math.abs(arr[left] - x) > Math.abs(arr[right] - x)) {
                left++;
            } else {
                right--;
            }
        }
        return Arrays.copyOfRange(arr, left, right + 1);
    }
}
```

